      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, thanks for catching this. Somehow I ignored this check, I thought it was some remnant of the old emulation code, since it doesn\u0027t look like `vcpu-\u003emode \u003d\u003d EXITING_GUEST_MODE` can ever be true here (since we set it to IN_GUEST_MODE just above). Now I see it can be true also if `kvm_request_pending(vcpu)`, regardless of vcpu-\u003emode, and yeah, in this particular case with req_immediate_exit it seems we are doomed to have an endless loop here.\n\nBTW can we remove the `vcpu-\u003emode \u003d\u003d EXITING_GUEST_MODE` check? I\u0027m not sure what was the reason for adding it in the first place...",
